      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive emergency and specialty doctors"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend the veterinarians, specialists, and nursing technicians for their calm expertise during critical health emergencies. Reviewers highlight Dr. Jeon, Dr. Hernandez, and Dr. Cortez for guiding families through challenging oncology diagnoses, complex surgical procedures, and compassionate end-of-life care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated care for critical patients"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents emphasize the hospital team's readiness to admit critically ill and injured animals around the clock. Reviewers describe life-saving interventions for internal trauma, coyote puncture wounds, and canine bloat. Owners appreciate the attentive overnight monitoring that ensures hospital patients remain comfortable and stable."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Consultation clarity with occasional gaps"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients praise doctors for detailed discussions about diagnostic scans, treatment timelines, and surgical recommendations. However, several reviewers noted communication lapses, citing delayed phone updates while waiting in the lobby and conflicting opinions regarding pre-operative procedures that caused administrative frustration."
      }
    }
  ],
